<p>Dear Alderperson <%= @name %>,</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to ENV["SITE_NAME"], ENV["SITE_URL"] %> offers free, opt-in email
  reminders that notify Ward <%= @ward %> residents the day before their
  street is swept&mdash;helping to reduce parking tickets, towing, and 311
  calls.
</p>

<p>The <%= Time.current.year %> Chicago street sweeping schedules are now live on our site.</p>

<ul>
  <li>No app, no account&mdash;just an email and a street address</li>
  <li>Free for residents and for your office</li>
  <li>Covers all 50 wards using City sweeping data</li>
</ul>

<p style="margin-top: 1.5em;">
  <%= render "shared/button",
        label: "Visit #{ENV["SITE_NAME"]}",
        url: ENV["SITE_URL"] %>
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 1.5em;">
  Want to share this with constituents? Here's some sample copy your office
  can drop into a newsletter or social post:
</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin: 0 0 1.25em;">
  <tr>
    <td style="border-left: 3px solid #1d4ed8; background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 10px 14px; color: #374151; font-style: italic;">
      Sign up for free street sweeping reminders at
      <%= link_to ENV["SITE_URL"], ENV["SITE_URL"] %>. You'll get an email the
      day before your street is swept&mdash;no app, no account.
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>Thank you for helping to keep Chicago's streets clean!</p>

<p style="font-size: 9pt; color: #6b7280;">
  <%= ENV["SITE_NAME"] %> is not affiliated with the City of Chicago. We do,
  however, work with City data officials to identify and resolve issues with
  the data provided by the Department of Streets and Sanitation.
</p>

<%= render "shared/email_footer", signoff: "Best regards," %>
